## [Search-and-pick fields: skip if already filled] (user, 2026-07-25)

For **My Information** search-and-pick / picker / prompt fields — How Did You Hear About Us, Country,
State, Phone Device Type, Country Phone Code — if the field **already holds a value, it is DONE**:
do not reopen it, do not re-search, do not clear and refill, even when the existing value differs
from the stored profile value. Those values come from the user's own Workday candidate profile, so
keeping them is the safer direction.
