Self Identify: those have a known-correct answer and must still CORRECT a wrong prefill — e.g. the
relocation "Yes, at the company's expense" clearing of a wrong checkbox, and Citi's prefilled-"Yes"
relatives/Senior-Management question being flipped to No.
